    "detailed_description": "Waking up in a cell with no memory, Cypress needs to find out what\u2019s happening \u2014 and more importantly, a way out. The only person around is Walter, a scientist who may be more than he seems. <br><br><i>Prism</i> is a dark &amp; psychological visual novel with elements of sci-fi. Its story is inspired by <i>999: Nine Hours, Nine Persons, Nine Doors</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163960/extras/6680a309fb0f62f87d700d56c649615e.poster.avif?t=1748558737\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163960/extras/6680a309fb0f62f87d700d56c649615e.webm?t=1748558737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163960/extras/6680a309fb0f62f87d700d56c649615e.mp4?t=1748558737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A short experience that can be enjoyed over a couple sittings<br></li><li> Multiple endings based on player choice <br></li><li> An original soundtrack composed by <i>niftyneatclub</i></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163960/extras/cc999518d9ec4a5253717a9da33b387c.avif?t=1748558737\" width=616 height=180 /></span>",
